stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Up
    Up --> Down: press(key)
    Down --> Up: release(key)
    Down --> Down: press(other key) [chord / rollover, held_count < max]
    Down --> Down: press(same key) [no-op: already held]

    state modifier_hold {
        [*] --> HeldMod
        HeldMod --> Up: release (chord or long) [no latch]
        HeldMod --> Latched: release (tap, latch_enabled)
        Latched --> Consumed: next qualifying key press [latched cleared]
        Consumed --> [*]
        Latched --> Locked: release double-tap (lock_enabled)
        HeldMod --> Locked: double-tap release
        Locked --> Unlocked: double-tap release [toggle]
        Locked --> [*]
    }

    Down --> HeldMod: modifier press
    Down --> Locked: lock key (CapsLock/NumLock) tap-release toggles
    Down --> Repeat: held repeatable key (RepeatEngine tick)
    Repeat --> Up: release(key)

    Down --> [*]: release_all (non-modifiers first, modifiers last)
    Latched --> [*]: release_all clears latched
    Locked --> [*]: release_all leaves locks (logical state)
